, and logistics capabilities enabling a global reach. In July 2025, we completed a significant decarbonization project at our Donaldsonville, Louisiana, complex to enable the production of low-carbon ammonia. Additionally, we are executing further decarbonization projects in our exist","zh":"我們的使命是提供清潔能源，為世界提供可持續的糧食和燃料。我們的員工專注於安全可靠的營運、環境管理以及嚴格的資本和企業管理，我們正在努力實現全球最大的氨生產網路脫碳，從而為能源、化肥、減排和其他工業活動提供低碳氫化合物和氮產品。我們的價值鏈由位於美國、加拿大和英國的製造基地、北美廣泛的倉儲、運輸和分銷網路以及覆蓋全球的物流能力組成。 2025 年 7 月，我們在路易斯安那州唐納森維爾工廠完成了一項重要的脫碳項目，以實現低碳氨的生產。此外，我們正在現有的基礎上執行進一步的脫碳項目"},{"en":"Our principal customers are cooperatives, retailers, independent fertilizer distributors, traders, wholesalers and industrial users. Our core product is anhydrous ammonia (ammonia), which contains 82% nitrogen and 18% hydrogen. Products derived from ammonia that are most often used as nitrogen fertilizers include granular urea, urea ammonium nitrate solution (UAN) and ammonium nitrate (AN). AN is also used extensively by the commercial explosives industry as a component of explosives. Products derived from ammonia that are sold primarily to industrial customers include diesel exhaust fluid (DEF), urea liquor, nitric acid and aqua ammonia. In addition, our low-carbon products are expected to be used for existing and new applications, such as power generation and steel production in Japan, and to help customers reduce the economic impact of European regulations on the price of carbon.","zh":"我們的主要客戶是合作社、零售商、獨立肥料經銷商、貿易商、批發商和工業用戶。我們的核心產品是無水氨（氨），其中含有82%的氮和18%的氫。最常用作氮肥的氨衍生產品包括顆粒尿素、尿素硝酸銨溶液 (UAN) 和硝酸銨 (AN)。 AN 也被商業炸藥工業廣泛用作炸藥的成分。主要銷售給工業客戶的氨衍生產品包括柴油引擎廢氣處理液 (DEF)、尿素液、硝酸和氨水。此外，我們的低碳產品預計將用於現有和新的應用，例如日本的發電和鋼鐵生產，並幫助客戶減少歐洲法規對碳價格的經濟影響。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Our primary products are ammonia, granular urea, UAN and AN. Our historical sales by segment are shown in the following table. Net sales do not reflect amounts used internally, such as ammonia, in the manufacture of other products.","zh":""},{"en":"Gross margin was $2.72 billion, $2.06 billion and $2.55 billion for the years ended December 31, 2025, 2024 and 2023, respectively.","zh":""}],"customers":[{"en":"The principal customers for our nitrogen products are cooperatives, retailers, independent fertilizer distributors, traders, wholesalers and industrial users. Sales are generated by our internal marketing and sales force. CHS was our largest customer in 2025 and accounted for approximately 13% of our consolidated net sales. We have a strategic venture with CHS under which CHS has a minority equity interest in CFN. See Note 18—Noncontrolling Interests for additional information on our strategic venture with CHS.","zh":"我們的氮產品的主要客戶是合作社、零售商、獨立肥料經銷商、貿易商、批發商和工業用戶。銷售額由我們的內部行銷和銷售人員產生。 CHS 是我們 2025 年最大的客戶，約占我們合併淨銷售額的 13%。我們與 CHS 建立了策略合資企業，CHS 擁有 CFN 的少數股權。有關我們與 CHS 策略合作的更多資訊，請參閱附註 18—非控制權益。"},{"en":"Our markets are global and intensely competitive, based primarily on delivered price and, to a lesser extent, on low-carbon attributes, reliability, customer service and product quality. During the peak demand periods, product availability and delivery time also play a role in the buying decisions of customers.","zh":"我們的市場是全球性的，競爭激烈，主要基於交付價格，其次是低碳屬性、可靠性、客戶服務和產品品質。在需求高峰期，產品可用性和交貨時間也在顧客的購買決策中發揮作用。"}],"competition":[{"en":"Our markets are global and intensely competitive, based primarily on delivered price and, to a lesser extent, on low-carbon attributes, reliability, customer service and product quality. During the peak demand periods, product availability and delivery time also play a role in the buying decisions of customers.","zh":"我們的市場是全球性的，競爭激烈，主要基於交付價格，其次是低碳屬性、可靠性、客戶服務和產品品質。在需求高峰期，產品可用性和交貨時間也在顧客的購買決策中發揮作用。"},{"en":"Our primary competitors with North American operations include Nutrien Ltd., Koch Fertilizer LLC, LSB Industries, CVR Partners, LP and Yara International. There is also significant competition from products sourced from other regions of the world, including some with lower natural gas or other feedstock costs, which may include the benefit of government subsidies. Because ammonia, urea and UAN are widely-traded fertilizer products and there are limited barriers to entry, we experience","zh":"我們在北美業務的主要競爭對手包括 Nutrien Ltd.、Koch Fertilizer LLC、LSB Industries、CVR Partners、LP 和 Yara International。來自世界其他地區的產品也存在激烈競爭，其中包括一些天然氣或其他原料成本較低的產品，其中可能包括政府補貼的好處。由於氨、尿素和尿素是廣泛交易的化肥產品，且進入障礙有限，因此我們經歷"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Ammonia","val":2176000000,"zh":"氨"},{"name":"UAN","val":2161000000,"zh":"烏安"},{"name":"Urea","val":1781000000,"zh":"尿素"},{"name":"All Other Segments","val":545000000,"zh":"所有其他部門"},{"name":"Other Products","val":545000000,"zh":"其他產品"},{"name":"Ammonium Nitrate","val":421000000,"zh":"硝酸銨部門"}],"total":7084000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"North America","val":5994000000,"zh":"北美洲"},{"name":"US","val":5338000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":1746000000,"zh":"非我們"},{"name":"Europeand Other","val":1090000000,"zh":"歐洲及其他"},{"name":"All Regions Outside Of US & Canada","val":712000000,"zh":"美國和加拿大以外的所有地區"},{"name":"CA","val":598000000,"zh":"加拿大"},{"name":"GB","val":378000000,"zh":"英國"},{"name":"North Americaexcluding United Statesand Canada","val":58000000,"zh":"北美（不包括美國和加拿大）"}],"total":7084000000}},"peers":["MOS","NTR","BG","FMC","IPI"]}}